  m_Name: Anna Kudlai
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PassengerData
  passengerName: Anna Kudlai
  portrait: {fileID: -855298285791758126, guid: 858b58bff9ff2ff458fe6167d69ed193, type: 3}
  healthPoints: 3
  charDescription: "Anna Kudlai, 40 years old, is a pregnant woman. She seems always
    tired and and isolate herself to cry from time to time. Talking with her \u2013
    but never, ever touching her \u2013 can lead her to reveal a seamstress who loved
    her job and lived under the occupation of the ennemy. Her father, taken prisoner
    by soldiers, was too old to survive the harsh condition of prison. She went to
    the officer in charge of the prison to beg for his freedom. He let him free in
    exchange of sexual favors, a traumatic memory making her nauseous. As her belly
    grew, his father quickly understood what happened and was furious. She flee the
    unfair shame brought upon her and try to find a new life elsewhere. However,
    she carry a gun and won't hesitate to fire at anyone trying to corner her or
    grab her."
  bonus:
  - enceinte
  - stresse
  - le calibre
  inkJSON: {fileID: 0}
